        <h1 class="ks-hero-title">Bhartiya Khel Sutra</h1>
        <p class="ks-hero-tagline">Play Traditions of India — An Immersive Spatial Archive</p>

        <p class="ks-hero-description">
            Rather than reducing ancient cultural games into a static catalog, 
            <strong>Bhartiya Khel Sutra</strong> was designed around spatial exploration. 
            I architected a digital world that allows users to traverse an illustrated school playground, 
            explore classrooms and akhara grounds, and uncover the living rules, histories, and mechanics of 
            <strong>75 traditional Indian games</strong>.
        </p>

        <!-- Project Snapshot Meta Bar -->
        <div class="ks-meta-grid">
