            <h2 class="ks-section-h2">Structuring 75 Games Across 9 Living Environments</h2>
            
            <p class="ks-body-text">
                The backbone of this project was converting an unstructured research spreadsheet into an intuitive taxonomy. 
                Each game belongs to both an <em>intellectual genre</em> and a <em>physical environment</em>.
            </p>

            <!-- IA Diagram Showcase -->
            <div class="ks-showcase-card">
                <img src="/images/khel-sutra/information-architecture.jpg" 
                     alt="Information Architecture taxonomy mapping 75 games into 9 zones" 
                     class="ks-showcase-img" />
                <div class="ks-showcase-caption">
                    <span><strong>Figure 1:</strong> Complete Information Architecture map dividing the archive into 9 zones and environmental spaces.</span>
                    <span class="ks-caption-tag">Taxonomy & Systems Thinking</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 9 Environments Cards Grid -->
            <div class="ks-ia-grid">
