                        <li>Lathi Khela (Staff combat)</li>
                        <li>Mardani Khel (Maratha martial art)</li>
                        <li>Kalaripayattu (Ancient discipline)</li>
                        <li>Mallakhamb (Acrobatic pole gymnastics)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="ks-ia-card">
                    <div class="ks-ia-number">09</div>
                    <h4 class="ks-ia-title">Buddhibala</h4>
                    <div class="ks-ia-sub">The Pavilion · 3 Games</div>
                    <ul class="ks-ia-list">
                        <li>Ganjifa (Circular painted playing cards)</li>
                        <li>Para Sho (Bhutanese / Tibetan heritage)</li>
                        <li>Shatranj (Precursor to modern chess)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
         4. DESIGN SYSTEM & TOKENS
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="ks-section">
        <div class="ks-container">
            <span class="ks-section-label">03 / Visual Design & System</span>
            <h2 class="ks-section-h2">Design Tokens Rooted in Earth, Clay & Ink</h2>

            <p class="ks-body-text">
                To bridge historical authenticity with high digital readability, I created a custom tokenized design system. 
                The typography pairs <strong>Fraunces</strong> (an editorial serif with organic warmth) with 
                <strong>Work Sans</strong> (a clean grotesque sans-serif for responsive UI and accessibility).
            </p>

            <div class="ks-palette-grid">
                <div class="ks-swatch" style="background: #1e2b1c; color: #f4efdf;">
                    <span class="ks-swatch-name">Ink</span>
                    <span class="ks-swatch-hex">#1E2B1C</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ks-swatch" style="background: #f4efdf; color: #1e2b1c;">
                    <span class="ks-swatch-name">Cream</span>
                    <span class="ks-swatch-hex">#F4EFDF</span>
