                    <span class="ks-swatch-hex">#B5502F</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ks-swatch" style="background: #cf9a3d; color: #1e2b1c;">
                    <span class="ks-swatch-name">Gold</span>
                    <span class="ks-swatch-hex">#CF9A3D</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ks-swatch" style="background: #6c8f8c; color: #1e2b1c;">
                    <span class="ks-swatch-name">Sky</span>
                    <span class="ks-swatch-hex">#6C8F8C</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ks-swatch" style="background: #efe7d0; color: #1e2b1c;">
                    <span class="ks-swatch-name">Warm-01</span>
                    <span class="ks-swatch-hex">#EFE7D0</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Illustration & Character Exploration -->
            <div class="ks-split-grid" style="margin-top: 48px;">
                <div class="ks-showcase-card" style="margin: 0;">
                    <img src="/images/khel-sutra/illustration-style-exploration.jpg" 
                         alt="Illustration style exploration showing traditional characters and children playing" 
                         class="ks-showcase-img" />
                    <div class="ks-showcase-caption">
                        <span><strong>Illustration Style Exploration:</strong> Developing warm, storybook character art depicting genuine community play.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="ks-showcase-card" style="margin: 0;">
                    <img src="/images/khel-sutra/building-visuals.jpg" 
                         alt="Pencil sketch to color rendering evolution of traditional players" 
                         class="ks-showcase-img" />
                    <div class="ks-showcase-caption">
                        <span><strong>Craft & Execution:</strong> From archival pencil line-work to rendered digital assets integrated into the UI.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
         5. WIREFRAMING & INTERACTION MODEL
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="ks-section">
        <div class="ks-container">
            <span class="ks-section-label">04 / Wireframing & Layout</span>
            <h2 class="ks-section-h2">Balancing Free Exploration with Direct Discovery</h2>
            
            <p class="ks-body-text">
                During low-fidelity prototyping, I designed two distinct ways for visitors to interact with the experience:
            </p>

            <div class="ks-split-grid">
                <div>
                    <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--ks-moss-deep); margin-bottom: 12px;">
                        1. The Spatial Free-Roam
                    </h3>
                    <p style="color: #4b5d47; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 18px;">
                        Users can click and drag the canvas horizontally and vertically. Pins on the playground 
                        reveal active games with micro-hover interactions. Clicking a zone transitions seamlessly 
                        into specialized environments (e.g., entering the Buddhiyoga Classroom or stepping onto the Sports Ground).
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--ks-moss-deep); margin-bottom: 12px;">
                        2. The Game Index & Search Drawer
                    </h3>
                    <p style="color: #4b5d47; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 18px;">
                        For educators, researchers, or parents searching for a specific title (e.g. "Indoor games for 4 players"), 
                        a persistent drawer provides faceted filtering by player count, complexity, material requirements, and historical period.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Wireframes Showcase -->
            <div class="ks-showcase-card">
                <img src="/images/khel-sutra/wireframes-1.jpg" 
                     alt="Low-fidelity wireframes showing map overview, filtered catalog, and detail card modal" 
                     class="ks-showcase-img" />
                <div class="ks-showcase-caption">
                    <span><strong>Wireframe Iterations:</strong> Testing navigation patterns, card density, and multi-tier filter overlays.</span>
                    <span class="ks-caption-tag">Interaction Design</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

